COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.business_object.contact_actor_id IS 'Contact. Optional managed contact with name and website/contact page. External links may stay in responsibleOrganisation. Apply only the documented parent fallback. Alias (DE): Kontakt. Canonical: BusinessObject.contactActorId.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.business_object.classification IS 'Classification. `public`, `internal`, `confidential`, `secret`. Classification of the described information, separate from technical access. Alias (DE): Klassifizierung. Canonical: BusinessObject.classification.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.business_object.contains_personal_data IS 'Personal data. Whether the described data contains personal data. Listing a catalog contact does not establish this for the underlying dataset. Alias (DE): Personendaten. Canonical: BusinessObject.containsPersonalData.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.business_object.domain_id IS 'Domain. Primary business domain. A copied domain label is not the relationship. Alias (DE): Domäne. Canonical: BusinessObject.domainId.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.business_object.normative_references IS 'Standard reference. Documented standards/rules, including edition when known. URLs belong in DocumentationLink. Alias (DE): Normreferenz. Canonical: BusinessObject.normativeReferences.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.business_object.edited_at IS 'Last edit timestamp. Server time of the latest app/REST edit; unknown for earlier imports. Separate from source freshness, definition version and historical dates. Alias (DE): Zeitpunkt der letzten Bearbeitung. Canonical: BusinessObject.editedAt.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.business_object.is_archived IS 'Archived. Defaults to false. Hides the entry from normal browsing while retaining identity, references and history; independent of status/verification. Alias (DE): Archiviert. Canonical: BusinessObject.isArchived.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.business_object.system_of_record_id IS 'System of record. Explicit default authoritative System for this business object. Null means no designation. Attributes inherit unless they set their own reference. Stored as system_of_record_id; existing System required. See [system of record](#system-of-record). Alias (DE): Führendes System. Canonical: BusinessObject.systemOfRecordId.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.id IS 'Internal ID. Immutable internal identity, separate from the public catalog identifier and source identifiers. Alias (DE): Interne ID. Canonical: ChangeEvent.id.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.identifier IS 'ID. Unique event identifier; never an array position. Alias (DE): Kennung. Canonical: ChangeEvent.identifier.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.record_actor_id IS 'Catalog entity. Changed catalog record. Alias (DE): Katalogeintrag. Canonical: ChangeEvent.record.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.record_domain_id IS 'Catalog entity. Changed catalog record. Alias (DE): Katalogeintrag. Canonical: ChangeEvent.record.';
