COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.record_data_table_id IS 'Catalog entity. Changed catalog record. Alias (DE): Katalogeintrag. Canonical: ChangeEvent.record.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.record_data_field_id IS 'Catalog entity. Changed catalog record. Alias (DE): Katalogeintrag. Canonical: ChangeEvent.record.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.record_data_product_id IS 'Catalog entity. Changed catalog record. Alias (DE): Katalogeintrag. Canonical: ChangeEvent.record.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.record_product_attribute_id IS 'Catalog entity. Changed catalog record. Alias (DE): Katalogeintrag. Canonical: ChangeEvent.record.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.record_data_service_id IS 'Catalog entity. Changed catalog record. Alias (DE): Katalogeintrag. Canonical: ChangeEvent.record.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.record_relationship_id IS 'Catalog entity. Changed catalog record. Alias (DE): Katalogeintrag. Canonical: ChangeEvent.record.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.record_lineage_relation_id IS 'Catalog entity. Changed catalog record. Alias (DE): Katalogeintrag. Canonical: ChangeEvent.record.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.occurred_on IS 'Date. Known event date. For events with occurredAt, use its UTC calendar date; preserve standalone legacy dates without inventing a timestamp. Alias (DE): Datum. Canonical: ChangeEvent.occurredOn.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.occurred_at IS 'Event timestamp. Exact event time when known; normalize to UTC. Its UTC calendar date must equal occurredOn. Keep legacy date-only events without this attribute. Alias (DE): Ereigniszeitpunkt. Canonical: ChangeEvent.occurredAt.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.action IS 'Change. `created`, `updated`, `imported`, `retired`, `restored`. Preserve unmapped original action wording in summaries. Alias (DE): Änderung. Canonical: ChangeEvent.action.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.actor_id IS 'Actor. Identified editor when available; this is edit attribution, not approval. Alias (DE): Akteur. Canonical: ChangeEvent.actorId.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.actor_name_de IS 'Edited by (DE). German. Name recorded at the time of the edit. Retained after Actor renames and for imported events without actorId; looking up the Actor would show its current name. Preserve known wording without translation or inferred identity. Alias (DE): Bearbeitet von (DE). Canonical: ChangeEvent.actorName_de.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.actor_name_it IS 'Edited by (IT). Italian. Name recorded at the time of the edit. Retained after Actor renames and for imported events without actorId; looking up the Actor would show its current name. Preserve known wording without translation or inferred identity. Alias (DE): Bearbeitet von (IT). Canonical: ChangeEvent.actorName_it.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.actor_name_fr IS 'Edited by (FR). French. Name recorded at the time of the edit. Retained after Actor renames and for imported events without actorId; looking up the Actor would show its current name. Preserve known wording without translation or inferred identity. Alias (DE): Bearbeitet von (FR). Canonical: ChangeEvent.actorName_fr.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.actor_name_en IS 'Edited by (EN). English. Name recorded at the time of the edit. Retained after Actor renames and for imported events without actorId; looking up the Actor would show its current name. Preserve known wording without translation or inferred identity. Alias (DE): Bearbeitet von (EN). Canonical: ChangeEvent.actorName_en.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.summary_de IS 'Details (DE). German. Change summary. At least one of the four summaries is required. Alias (DE): Details (DE). Canonical: ChangeEvent.summary_de.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.summary_it IS 'Details (IT). Italian. Change summary. At least one of the four summaries is required. Alias (DE): Details (IT). Canonical: ChangeEvent.summary_it.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.summary_fr IS 'Details (FR). French. Change summary. At least one of the four summaries is required. Alias (DE): Details (FR). Canonical: ChangeEvent.summary_fr.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.summary_en IS 'Details (EN). English. Change summary. At least one of the four summaries is required. Alias (DE): Details (EN). Canonical: ChangeEvent.summary_en.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.changed_properties IS 'Changed properties. Canonical property paths, including the exact language suffix for translated text, where known. Alias (DE): Geänderte Attribute. Canonical: ChangeEvent.changedProperties.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.before IS 'Before change. Snapshot before the changed record/owned edit, absent for creation. Legacy events may lack it. Contains direct values and command-specific owned data, without linked-record expansion or derived counts; see the audit-format notes below. Alias (DE): Vor der Änderung. Canonical: ChangeEvent.before.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.after IS 'After change. Snapshot after the edit, required for all new events; retirement retains the record and snapshot. Legacy history may omit it; never reconstruct unknown past values. Alias (DE): Nach der Änderung. Canonical: ChangeEvent.after.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.change_event.import_id IS 'Import or operation ID. Shared operation identifier grouping related events from an import, batch or multi-record command. Required for new commands emitting multiple events, including relationship/product edits. One generated value is reused across retries; no separate operation entity is required. Alias (DE): Import- oder Vorgangskennung. Canonical: ChangeEvent.importId.';
