COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.data_service.status IS 'Status. `draft`, `valid`, `retired`; new records default to draft. Status changes are manual and audited; source publication alone does not establish the correctness of local interpretations. Alias (DE): Status. Canonical: DataService.status.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.data_service.version IS 'Version. Catalog definition version, if managed; paired with versionDate. Separate from source editions, serviceVersion and the technical rowVersion. Alias (DE): Version. Canonical: DataService.version.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.data_service.version_date IS 'Version date. Date this catalog definition version was issued. Required for a newly assigned/changed version; absent without version. Preserve unknown legacy dates. Not an import, last-edit or service-release date. Alias (DE): Versionsdatum. Canonical: DataService.versionDate.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.data_service.responsible_organisation IS 'Responsible organisation. Inline organisation; no Actor required. Apply the documented parent fallback only when this whole value is absent. Alias (DE): Verantwortliche Organisation. Canonical: DataService.responsibleOrganisation.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.data_service.data_owner_id IS 'Data owner. Accountable person/organisation. One optional Actor; apply only the documented parent fallback. Alias (DE): Dateneigner. Canonical: DataService.dataOwnerId.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.data_service.data_steward_id IS 'Data steward. Person/organisation maintaining meaning and metadata. One optional Actor; apply only the documented parent fallback. Alias (DE): Datenverwalter. Canonical: DataService.dataStewardId.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.data_service.data_custodian_id IS 'Data custodian. Maintains the technical source; may be a person or organisation. One explicit actor per role; missing means undocumented or inherited as specified below. Alias (DE): Datenhalter. Canonical: DataService.dataCustodianId.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.data_service.contact_actor_id IS 'Contact. Optional managed contact with name and website/contact page. External links may stay in responsibleOrganisation. Apply only the documented parent fallback. Alias (DE): Kontakt. Canonical: DataService.contactActorId.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.data_service.classification IS 'Classification. `public`, `internal`, `confidential`, `secret`. Classification of the described information, separate from technical access. Alias (DE): Klassifizierung. Canonical: DataService.classification.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.data_service.contains_personal_data IS 'Personal data. Whether the described data contains personal data. Listing a catalog contact does not establish this for the underlying dataset. Alias (DE): Personendaten. Canonical: DataService.containsPersonalData.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.data_service.system_id IS 'System. Providing system, if identified. External services need no invented system assignment. Alias (DE): System. Canonical: DataService.systemId.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.data_service.domain_id IS 'Domain. Primary catalog classification. Alias (DE): Domäne. Canonical: DataService.domainId.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.data_service.technical_name IS 'Technical name. Official interface identifier. Alias (DE): Technischer Name. Canonical: DataService.technicalName.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.data_service.service_version IS 'Service version. Source interface release, separate from catalog `version`. Alias (DE): Schnittstellenversion. Canonical: DataService.serviceVersion.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.data_service.purpose IS 'Purpose. `recordAccess`, `featureAccess`, `mapImage`, `download`, `mixed`. Map display does not imply polygon extraction. Alias (DE): Zweck. Canonical: DataService.purpose.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.data_service.access_mode IS 'Access. `public`, `internal`, `restricted`. Alias (DE): Zugang. Canonical: DataService.accessMode.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.data_service.access_notes IS 'Access notes. Access restrictions and limitations. One value in its authored language; no translation variants or fallback. Alias (DE): Zugangshinweise. Canonical: DataService.accessNotes.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.data_service.endpoint_description_urls IS 'Interface descriptions. Machine-readable interface descriptions, such as OpenAPI, WSDL or capabilities documents. Human help pages stay in DocumentationLink. Alias (DE): Schnittstellenbeschreibungen. Canonical: DataService.endpointDescriptionUrls.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.data_service.edited_at IS 'Last edit timestamp. Server time of the latest app/REST edit; unknown for earlier imports. Separate from source freshness, definition version and historical dates. Alias (DE): Zeitpunkt der letzten Bearbeitung. Canonical: DataService.editedAt.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.data_service.is_archived IS 'Archived. Defaults to false. Hides the entry from normal browsing while retaining identity, references and history; independent of status/verification. Alias (DE): Archiviert. Canonical: DataService.isArchived.';
