COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.service_endpoint.operation_name IS 'Operation name. Exact operation identifier, never translated. Alias (DE): Operationsname. Canonical: ServiceEndpoint.operationName.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.service_endpoint.environment IS 'Environment. `production`, `test`, `development`, only when documented. Alias (DE): Umgebung. Canonical: ServiceEndpoint.environment.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.service_endpoint.is_read_only IS 'Read-only. Documented behaviour, not inferred from the operation label. Alias (DE): Nur lesend. Canonical: ServiceEndpoint.isReadOnly.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.service_endpoint.supports_bulk IS 'Bulk access supported. Explicit bulk capability; not inferred from pagination or a sample response. Alias (DE): Massenzugriff unterstützt. Canonical: ServiceEndpoint.supportsBulk.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.service_endpoint.authentication_methods IS 'Authentication methods. Documented mechanism names. No passwords, tokens or private credentials. Alias (DE): Authentifizierungsmethoden. Canonical: ServiceEndpoint.authenticationMethods.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.service_endpoint.verification_status IS 'Verification status. `notChecked`, `metadataChecked`, `sampleChecked`, `accessDenied`, `failed`; defaults to notChecked. Editors must document the operation-scoped result. The current command validates the token and creates generic history; it does not require or verify a custom test report. Alias (DE): Prüfstatus. Canonical: ServiceEndpoint.verificationStatus.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.service_endpoint.sort_order IS 'Row order. Display order within the service, from 0 through 2147483647 (SQL integer); default 0. Ties are permitted. Alias (DE): Zeilenreihenfolge. Canonical: ServiceEndpoint.sortOrder.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.service_endpoint.is_archived IS 'Archived. Defaults to false. Hides the endpoint from the normal endpoint list without deleting its identity or references. Alias (DE): Archiviert. Canonical: ServiceEndpoint.isArchived.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.service_endpoint.row_version IS 'Edit revision. Server-maintained positive revision, initially 1. An endpoint edit also advances the service revision. Alias (DE): Bearbeitungsrevision. Canonical: ServiceEndpoint.rowVersion.';
