COMMENT ON COLUMN catalog.system.responsible_organisation IS 'Responsible organisation. Inline organisation; no Actor required. Apply the documented parent fallback only when this whole value is absent. Alias (DE): Verantwortliche Organisation. Canonical: System.responsibleOrganisation.';
